# Public repository allowlist
#
# MARS is intentionally published only as a directly runnable mitigation and
# TensorRT-compilation pipeline. Everything is ignored unless explicitly
# allowed below. Ignored files remain available in the local research checkout.
/*

# Root runtime, documentation, and legal files
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/CITATION.cff
!/RELEASING.md
!/PUBLICATION.md
!/pipeline.svg
!/model.svg
!/mars.py
!/compile_tensorrt.py
!/config.json
!/requirements.txt

# The one production checkpoint required for immediate PyTorch use
!/artifacts/
/artifacts/*
!/artifacts/checkpoints/
/artifacts/checkpoints/*
!/artifacts/checkpoints/mars-paper-historical/
/artifacts/checkpoints/mars-paper-historical/*
!/artifacts/checkpoints/mars-paper-historical/best_f1.pt

# Minimal source required by mars.py and compile_tensorrt.py
!/src/
/src/*
!/src/mars_rfi/
/src/mars_rfi/*
!/src/mars_rfi/__init__.py
!/src/mars_rfi/config.py
!/src/mars_rfi/export_tensorrt.py
!/src/mars_rfi/mitigate.py
!/src/mars_rfi/model.py
!/src/mars_rfi/pipeline.py
!/src/mars_rfi/preprocess.py
!/src/mars_rfi/provenance.py

# LEONET research is local-only and must not enter public releases.
# Keep these exclusions after the allowlist. Match files and directories at
# any depth, including mixed-case names and bundled copies of experiments.
*[Ll][Ee][Oo][Nn][Ee][Tt]*
/ts128_codex_supplement_*
/README_FILTOOL_PRESTO_TS128_REPRODUCTION.md
